      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Saanich’s landscape is shaped by water, boasting 8.17 square kilometres of freshwater lakes and 29.61 kilometres of marine shoreline.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
